{"title":"Shagbark Bow","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Bowyer Lv 46) · Monster drop: Virikh, Ogre Butcher, Elder Briar Warden, Captain Rhazin, Virikh Templar +4 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 40 · DEX 100 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Bow</b> weapon skill</a>. <b>Archers</b> start with it. Everyone else can study a <b>Bow tome</b> (1 skill point; vendors no longer sell them, so look on the Exchange).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Bowyer at level 46 <span class=\"muted\">(2938 XP)</span> from 4× <a href=\"#/item/shagbark-wood\">Shagbark Wood</a>, 8× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh-lord\" title=\"Lord Kael The Wyrmbreaker - dropped it in 1 of 2 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/1f6bd03b8107c4b5690b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lord Kael The Wyrmbreaker</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"elder-briar-warden\" title=\"Elder Briar Warden - dropped it in 3 of 44 looted corpses (1/15)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/3281b5fe47b789f85acb.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Elder Briar Warden</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-captain\" title=\"Captain Rhazin - dropped it in 1 of 29 looted corpses (1/29)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/b9a61e60c6aa717553b1.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Captain Rhazin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/29<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh\" title=\"Virikh - dropped it in 2 of 182 looted corpses (1/91)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4dbed39ea4505123159.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/91<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+5 more\">+5 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-carver\" title=\"Gutrot The Carver - dropped it in 1 of 98 looted corpses (1/98)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1f884f2242ac6c9d138c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gutrot The Carver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/98<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"briar-warden\" title=\"Briar Warden - dropped it in 1 of 127 looted corpses (1/127)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/063ade370878ba4c7c5b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Briar Warden</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/127<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh-templar\" title=\"Virikh Templar - dropped it in 1 of 188 looted corpses (1/188)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7c6325d168ea4e24bc71.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Templar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/188<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 2 of 980 looted corpses (1/490)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/490<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-spearman\" title=\"Thak Spearman - dropped it in 1 of 495 looted corpses (1/495)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4bb5ae8c7fe265fd4ca.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Spearman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/495<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"shagbark-bow\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/bowyer\">Bowyer</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-good\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow?q=good\">Good <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow?q=superior\">Superior <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"shagbark-bow\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"seeking\">Seeking</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Damage below is the weapon alone, before your stats and enchantments.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>vs Ordinary</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/6ad40ed0b4459385c272.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>3.2–25.5 damage</td><td>-6.1 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/6ad40ed0b4459385c272.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>3.6–29.2 damage</td><td>-4.1 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/6ad40ed0b4459385c272.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>4.1–32.8 damage</td><td>-2.1 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/shagbark-bow?q=ordinary\" title=\"Show it at Ordinary\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/6ad40ed0b4459385c272.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></td><td>0%</td><td>4.6–36.4 damage</td><td>0 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">3 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/shagba